            </div>
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="testi-avatar">MS</div>
              <p>"Booked through WhatsApp in two minutes. Staff were warm and the backdrops looked premium."</p>
              <strong>Meena S.</strong><span>★★★★★</span>
            </div>
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="testi-avatar">AV</div>
              <p>"Our newborn's first photos turned out so soft and dreamy. The team was so patient with our baby."</p>
              <strong>Anitha V.</strong><span>★★★★★</span>
            </div>
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="testi-avatar">RS</div>
              <p>"The crawling milestone shoot props were adorable — my son loved exploring the colourful set."</p>
              <strong>Rajesh S.</strong><span>★★★★★</span>
            </div>
            <div class="testi-card">
              <div class="testi-avatar">KJ</div>
              <p>"A full family portrait session that felt relaxed and unhurried. Beautiful, natural results."</p>
