            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="testi-nav testi-next" id="testiNext" aria-label="Next testimonial">›</button>
      </div>
      <div class="testi-dots" id="testiDots"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= THEMES ================= -->
  <section class="section" id="themes">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow center">100+ Curated Concepts</p>
      <h2 class="section-title center">Photoshoot Themes</h2>
      <p class="section-sub center">Browse a few of our favourite ready-made themes below. We have 100+ more in-studio —
        get the full PDF catalogue sent straight to your WhatsApp.</p>

      <div class="theme-grid">
        <div class="theme-card reveal-up">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('media/theme/t-1.webp')"></div>
          <div class="theme-body">
            <h3>Crimson Hearts &amp; Roses</h3>
            <p>Romantic red-rose drapery, heart balloons &amp; a cosy fur chair — perfect for anniversaries &amp;
