            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block theme-download" data-theme-name="Boss Baby Blue Bash">Get This
              Theme PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-card reveal-up">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('media/theme/t-3.webp')"></div>
          <div class="theme-body">
            <h3>Royal Peacock Throne</h3>
            <p>A regal teal velvet throne framed by peacock feathers &amp; a gilded arch — fit for little royalty</p>
            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block theme-download" data-theme-name="Royal Peacock Throne">Get This
              Theme PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-card reveal-up">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('media/theme/t-4.webp')"></div>
          <div class="theme-body">
            <h3>Enchanted Birdcage Garden</h3>
            <p>A gold birdcage seat surrounded by purple blooms &amp; ABC blocks — dreamy for first birthdays</p>
            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block theme-download" data-theme-name="Enchanted Birdcage Garden">Get
              This Theme PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-card reveal-up">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('media/theme/t-5.webp')"></div>
          <div class="theme-body">
            <h3>Pastel Butterfly Garden</h3>
            <p>Whimsical watercolour butterflies, a picket fence &amp; garden lanterns for a soft milestone shoot</p>
            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block theme-download" data-theme-name="Pastel Butterfly Garden">Get This
              Theme PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-card reveal-up">
          <div class="theme-img" style="background-image:url('media/theme/t-6.webp')"></div>
